WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.920
Hi, I'm Donna. I manage a large marketing team here in California and I'm a

00:07.920 --> 00:13.360
mother of three beautiful kids, one with special needs and I really wanted to

00:13.360 --> 00:21.200
share the results of working with Shree. Managing a big team can sometimes be

00:21.200 --> 00:29.400
challenging with deadlines, handling various projects, managing my little kids,

00:29.400 --> 00:37.400
can sometimes be overwhelming. Needless to say I was stressed out and having

00:37.400 --> 00:44.920
panic attacks which affected my health and my bond with my kids. I was fortunate

00:44.920 --> 00:51.560
to meet Shree who was able to get into the root cause that was rooted in my

00:51.560 --> 00:58.400
childhood and growing years. We were able to shift it almost instantly and

00:58.400 --> 01:07.360
the difference was night and day because I became more calm and peaceful my

01:07.360 --> 01:14.720
efficiency and performance at work went up. My team recognized the change very

01:14.720 --> 01:21.680
quickly and I am able to have a much deeper bond with my kids which is

01:21.680 --> 01:29.280
priceless. Shree I can't thank you enough for your love and care and for helping me

01:29.280 --> 01:38.640
hope a lot of people get to experience your magic. Thank you so much.

